queue priority into the VLM candidate packet and SourceFigureAsset review queue inputs while preserving candidate-only/no-acceptance/no-rights/no-display-final boundaries.\n\n## Boundaries\n\n- No learner personal data, tokens, secrets, signed URLs, sensitive free-form content, or full PDF/page dumps are retained in the queue artifacts.\n- No Supabase mutation, remote analytics write, storage upload, or external VLM call is performed.\n- This does not claim launch readiness, rights approval, visual acceptance, SourceVisualReceipt approval, student-display final eligibility, official scoring readiness, or Method Map truth.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-visual-usage-figureasset-priority-queue.mjs --check`\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-figureasset-vlm-candidate-packet-shard.mjs --check`\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-source-figure-asset-candidates.mjs --check`\n- `node --experimental-vm-modules /home/samsen/code/ciecopilot-home/node_modules/jest/bin/jest.js --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/visual-usage-figureasset-priority-queue.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/figureasset-vlm-candidate-packet.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/source-figure-asset-candidates.test.js scripts/learning/__tests__/full-beta-3530-attempt-event-contract.test.js src/pages/paper-workspace/__tests__/full-beta-visual-blocked-runtime.test.js --verbose`\n- artifact-only privacy scan for injected sensitive payloads: pass, 0 hits\n- `git diff --check`\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json`\n","created_at":"2026-07-03T10:12:13Z","updated_at":"2026-07-03T11:07:43Z","closed_at":"2026-07-03T11:07:43Z","merged_at":"2026-07-03T11:07:43Z","merge_commit_sha":"073bc1e868c421bde6098bc1d3f80f1299b81ab6","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1227/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/r